SUMMARY:Live Music with Mitch Gregory at Cherry Crest Adventure Farm
DESCRIPTION:Check out our amazing lineup of musicians that will be performi
 ng live right here at the farm! Join us on select Friday evenings and Satu
 rdays for toe-tapping tunes from our favorite bands. Mitch is a multi-inst
 rumentalist playing guitar\, slide guitar\, the Wazinator\, and is an acco
 mplished harmonica player\, and vocalist. Since the 80’s Mitch has perfo
 rmed through out Pennsylvania – Jazz\, Blues and Rock collaborations in 
 2019\, Mitch began entertaining as a solo performer. Mitch embarked on an 
 eighteen month residency at the Boomerang/Harrisburg Comedy Zone focused o
 n the blues and assembling material for his current project MITCH GREGORY 
 BLUES. Mitch is performing Texas blues\, New Orleans blues\, Chicago blues
 \, British and country blues in the styles of: Stevie Ray Vaughan\, ZZ Top
 \, BB King\, Dr. John\, Stray Cats\, Rolling Stones\, The music of Louis J
 ordan and much more. Additional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster? Kids’ Att
